            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Hanani, umwe wo muri bene wacu, araza azananye n’abantu bamwe bavuye i Buyuda. Mbabaza inkuru z’amasigarira y’ Abayuda, abāri barasigaye batajanywe ar’ inyagano, mbabaza n’ inkuru z’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.2"
            ]
          }
