        {
          "text": "Barambgira, bat’ Abāri barasigaye mur’ ico gihugu batājanywe ar’ inyagano bari n’amarushwa menshi n’ibitētērwa, kand’ inzitiro z’ amabuye z’i Yerusalemu zarasenyutse, n’amarembo yaho yarahiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
