        {
          "text": "Eka twaragucumuyeko bikomeye, ntitwitondeye ivyagezwe vyawe n’ivyo washinze n’amabgirizwa yawe, ivyo wageze umusavyi wawe Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
