            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bgirukiro, ndakwinginze, tega ugutwi wumve ugusenga kwanje, jewe umusavyi wawe, wumve n’ugusenga kw’ abasavyi bawe bakunda kwubaha izina ryawe, untabare jewe umusavyi wawe, umpe kugira amahirwe uyu musi, no guhangazwa n’uwo muntu nsavye.",
